Z||000013||Flamberge||10-09-2001||01:11 AM||||The first seven of my VIN are "1G2PG11".... so I guess it is a GT? <P>Thanks for the compliment on how my Fiero looks =) I need to post the other two I had. (I hate to admit this, but I always name my Fieros and place the name in the space to the right (over the tach.) It is the hole that matches the odo but doesn't have anything.)<P>This is definately the centralized Fiero Community I have always dreamed of. *snif*  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>- Patrick (Flamberge)||||reg||10
Z||000014||Haze_Performance||10-09-2001||01:54 AM||||<B>First off...</B> WELCOME TO THE FORUM!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><B>Second...</B> I really like the look of White 88 GT's. They look so clean. Very nice car.<P><B>Third...<FONT COLOR="red"><FONT SIZE="3"> PLEASE REMOVE THE FORMULA & STRIPES </B></FONT></FONT>(unless you really like them?)<P><B>Forth...</B> Welcome Again...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <P><I>-Haze</I><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">              .              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">        <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||6
Z||000015||Flamberge||10-09-2001||04:09 AM||||Third... PLEASE REMOVE THE FORMULA & STRIPES (unless you really like them?)<P>Hehehe the one thing I do like about them is that my Fiero is known on my side of Denver. There is another White fastback somewhere around here, I saw it about three weeks ago, but it never prowls my area... Fieros must be territorial. =)<P>One day (after I graduate from college and get a real job) I will fix her up the way she deserves... for now she is okay, the only maintenance I do on her is preventative. My car made me do a u-turn in busy traffic to go back to it, since it had a for sale sign in the window. It is the nicest Fiero I had ever seen in person...still is so far.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Forth... Welcome Again...  <P>Thank you, and everyone else! I will try to avoid already discussed topics.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>- Flamberge<BR>||||reg||7
